`PropertyNode` might be a legal token in a different API namespace?�particularly a style ring or display name?�even though it is not a Traverse class name. NI documents a node?�s `Style` separately as ?�the type of node,??and New VI Object?�s style is distinct from its object-class input. [NI: Node Style](https://www.ni.com/docs/en-NF/csh?context=lvcore_lvscript_node_style)

